+
+Do not narrate routine tool calls, file reads, searches, commands, ordinary successful checks, or lists of obvious next steps. Explain a consequential next action and its purpose when it clarifies the direction. Prefer one or two short sentences per update; use more only when accuracy or a mandatory status requires it. Do not repeat previously reported state. Follow any higher-priority platform-required progress cadence without padding messages with invented news.
 
